---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — JobLens | Kun Li" description="JobLens privacy policy. No data collected.">
  <main class="privacy-page grid-page">
    <a href="/job-lens/" class="back-link">&larr; JobLens</a>

    <header class="privacy-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: March 12, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What JobLens Does</h2>
      <p>JobLens is a Chrome extension that helps you filter LinkedIn job listings. It runs entirely in your browser on LinkedIn job pages.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Data Collection</h2>
      <p>JobLens does <strong>not</strong> collect, transmit, or store any personal data. Specifically:</p>
      <ul class="privacy-list">
        <li>No analytics or tracking of any kind</li>
        <li>No data sent to external servers</li>
        <li>No cookies set by the extension</li>
        <li>No user accounts or sign-in</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Local Storage</h2>
      <p>JobLens saves your preferences (skipped companies, skipped title keywords, toggle states) using Chrome's local storage API. This data stays on your device and is never transmitted anywhere.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Permissions</h2>
      <ul class="privacy-list">
        <li><strong>storage</strong> — to save your filter preferences locally</li>
        <li><strong>Host permission (linkedin.com/jobs/*)</strong> — to read and annotate job listings on LinkedIn</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>JobLens loads the EB Garamond font from Google Fonts. Google's privacy policy applies to that request. No other third-party services are used.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach out at <a href="/job-lens/" class="privacy-link">kunli.co/job-lens</a>.</p>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .privacy-header h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .privacy-updated {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .section p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .privacy-list {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-list li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .privacy-list li::marker {
    color: var(--color-rose);
  }

  .privacy-list strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .privacy-link {
    color: var(--color-rose);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .privacy-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
